message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "A literature-constrained and data-driven DNA methylation biomarker panel for endometrial cancer detection"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Wuwenbo
repository-code: "https://github.com/wuwenbo0626/UCEC_methylation_biomarker"
url: "https://github.com/wuwenbo0626/UCEC_methylation_biomarker"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains a reproducible Python workflow for TCGA-UCEC DNA
  methylation biomarker discovery, fully nested cross-validation, literature-
  constrained panel construction, and external validation using GEO GSE155760.
keywords:
  - DNA methylation
  - endometrial cancer
  - TCGA-UCEC
  - biomarker discovery
  - machine learning
  - external validation
